{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Hardly Workin'",
    "steam_appid": 3724110,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardly Workin' is a chaotic office sim where you play as Buddy Inepta, a supreme slacker. Your goal? Slack off<i> just</i>\u00a0enough to stay awake, dodge your boss, and manage to finish all your work before 5:00 PM.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Silly Meter</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Silly Meter keeps you awake. If it hits zero, you'll doze off and get fired! Stay silly to stay employed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Silly Tasks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toss paper, fish into other cubicles, or cook a pizza! Your cubicle is your oyster-explore it and find fun ways to get silly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evil Karen</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss lady Karen is<i> always</i>\u00a0on patrol. Get caught slacking three times and you'll be promoted to customer &gt;:(</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work Tasks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish your work tasks on the computer before 5:00 PM or you're toast! Done early? A clock out button becomes available from your desktop once you're ready to call it a day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coworker Chit-Chat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coworkers will drop by with questions! Answer correctly and get a big boost to your Silly Meter. Hints are scattered around your cubicle, so keep your eyes peeled!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardly Workin' is a chaotic office sim where you play as Buddy Inepta, a supreme slacker. Your goal? Slack off<i> just</i>\u00a0enough to stay awake, dodge your boss, and manage to finish all your work before 5:00 PM.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Silly Meter</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Silly Meter keeps you awake. If it hits zero, you'll doze off and get fired! Stay silly to stay employed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Silly Tasks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toss paper, fish into other cubicles, or cook a pizza! Your cubicle is your oyster-explore it and find fun ways to get silly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evil Karen</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss lady Karen is<i> always</i>\u00a0on patrol. Get caught slacking three times and you'll be promoted to customer &gt;:(</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work Tasks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish your work tasks on the computer before 5:00 PM or you're toast! Done early? A clock out button becomes available from your desktop once you're ready to call it a day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coworker Chit-Chat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coworkers will drop by with questions! Answer correctly and get a big boost to your Silly Meter. Hints are scattered around your cubicle, so keep your eyes peeled!</p>",
    "short_description": "Balance your work and fun in this goofy and chaotic office simulator! Avoid falling asleep on the job by slacking off in the goofiest ways possible. Just don't get caught by your boss Karen!",
